  m_text: 'Which Witch License is a point-and-click movement game.


    Movement:
    Aim at the blue stars and click to fly toward them.


    Range: When your crosshair
    turns yellow, you are within range to move.


    Objective: Reach the goal gem
    and click when it turns green to clear the stage.


    Strategy: Your travel
    distance per jump is limited. Plan your route carefully!'
